  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique Resilience and Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme strengthens Mozambique&#x2019;s ability to anticipate, withstand, and respond to climate and conflict shocks, reducing the country&#x2019;s acute vulnerability and associated risks to UK development, commercial, and security interests. It delivers this through three complementary pillars: technical partnerships to mobilise climate finance and address conflict drivers; resilience-building investments supporting the UK&#x2019;s shift from donor to investor; and targeted humanitarian assistance that enables a more effective, locally led crisis response.</narrative>
  </description>
